# NOTICE — glasspane-harness

## What this is

`glasspane-harness` is a private, product-grade customization of the open-source project
**opencode** (`anomalyco/opencode`, formerly `sst/opencode`). It is developed in the
GlassPane repository under `harness/glasspane-harness/` and distributed as its own
repository (`jingzhao-l/glasspane-harness`) and npm packages (`glasspane-harness` +
`glasspane-harness-<platform>`).

The product adds GlassPane's native `gp_*` tool surface, the evidence-discipline
constraints that go with it (judgement stays in the Swift engine, hash-chained decision
log, compaction-safe evidence anchors), and the product identity described in
`product.json` / `FORK.md`.

